  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 5 of Behind the Scenes. At the Star Night red carpet, backstage crew members guide cheering fan clubs while host Wen Simo tries to calm two commentators arguing live on air and reporter Bianbian spots a scoop. Listen to the Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这是什么东西？赶紧拿好，车来了，快点！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "大家慢点啊，粉丝真的是整团来，这么热情！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现在红毯正在进行当中。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "红毯现在已经过半了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "但是最让人期待的大咖其实还在后面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "请问你最期待哪位明星在红毯上亮相呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "两位老师，冷静冷静！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "请坐下来慢慢聊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "边边，辛惠美来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "辛惠美算什么呀？我知道更好玩的，你去拍吧！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "这是什么东西？赶紧拿好，车来了，快点！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is this? Hold onto it quickly, the car is here, hurry up!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "大家慢点啊，粉丝真的是整团来，这么热情！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Take it easy everyone; the whole fan club really came out, so enthusiastic!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现在红毯正在进行当中。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The red carpet is currently underway.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "红毯现在已经过半了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The red-carpet walk is already past the halfway mark.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "但是最让人期待的大咖其实还在后面。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet the biggest stars everyone is waiting for are actually still to come.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "请问你最期待哪位明星在红毯上亮相呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Which celebrity are you most looking forward to seeing on the red carpet?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "两位老师，冷静冷静！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Teachers, please calm down!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "请坐下来慢慢聊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please sit down and talk things over calmly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "边边，辛惠美来了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bianbian, Xin Huimei has arrived!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "辛惠美算什么呀？我知道更好玩的，你去拍吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is Xin Huimei compared to this? I found something much more fun; go film it!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
